#: src/edit.js:91
msgid "A terminal recording, right in your post."
msgstr "在文章中直接播放终端录屏。"

#: src/edit.js:139
msgid ""
"A valid recording URL loads its preview automatically, including when "
"reopening this editor. That server receives your browser’s request. "
"Published players contact the same server. Use a direct .cast URL; external "
"servers must allow CORS."
msgstr ""
"有效的录制文件 URL 会自动加载预览，重新打开编辑器时也一样。文件所在服务器会收到浏览器请求，发布后的播放器也会访问该服务器。请使用 .cast "
"文件直链；外部服务器需允许跨域请求（CORS）。"

#: src/edit.js:165
msgid "Add a caption…"
msgstr "添加说明文字…"

#: asciicast-player.php:1
msgid ""
"Add interactive terminal recordings to posts and pages with a block or "
"shortcode."
msgstr "通过区块或简码在文章和页面中添加可交互的终端录屏。"

