#: src/edit.js:117
msgid ""
"Display width scales the recording without changing its terminal columns or "
"rows. Add a caption directly below the player."
msgstr "显示宽度只缩放画面，不改变终端行列数。可在播放器下方直接添加说明文字。"

#: src/edit.js:115
msgid ""
"Enter a positive width with a unit, such as 480px or 65%. The last valid "
"width is kept."
msgstr "请输入带单位的正数宽度，例如 480px 或 65%。将保留上一次有效的宽度。"

#: src/edit.js:163
msgid ""
"Enter a recording URL to load its preview automatically. Playback starts "
"only when you press play."
msgstr "输入录制文件 URL 后会自动加载预览，点击播放才会开始播放。"

#: src/edit.js:155
msgid "Enter an HTTP(S) recording URL or a path starting with a single /."
msgstr "请输入 HTTP(S) 录制文件 URL，或以单个 / 开头的路径。"

#: src/edit.js:91
msgid "Example terminal recording"
msgstr "终端录屏示例"

#: src/edit.js:135
msgid "Fit"
msgstr "缩放方式"

#: src/edit.js:12
#: src/edit.js:13
