msgstr "使用录制尺寸"

#: src/edit.js:89
msgid "Height (legacy)"
msgstr "按高度缩放（旧版）"

#: src/edit.js:135
msgid "Height-based fitting requires a fixed container height in your site CSS."
msgstr "按高度缩放需要在站点 CSS 中设置固定的容器高度。"

#: src/edit.js:167
msgid ""
"Height-based previews use the shortcode’s fixed height when available, or a "
"320px editor frame. Published height still comes from your container style."
msgstr "按高度缩放的预览会使用简码中的固定高度；未设置时使用 320px 的编辑器预览高度。发布后的高度仍由容器样式决定。"

#: src/edit.js:138
msgid "Help"
msgstr "帮助"

#: src/edit.js:133
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

