#: src/preview.js:90
msgid "Loading recording…"
msgstr "正在加载录制文件…"

#: src/edit.js:124
msgid ""
"Loads the recording before the visitor presses play. The editor preview "
"always preloads a valid recording URL."
msgstr "在访客点击播放前加载录制文件。编辑器预览始终会预加载有效的录制文件 URL。"

#: src/edit.js:122
msgid "Loop playback"
msgstr "循环播放"

#: src/edit.js:87
msgid "Original size"
msgstr "原始大小"

#: src/edit.js:15
msgid ""
"Placeholders show the recording’s original columns and rows once loaded. "
"Leave blank to follow its terminal size and recorded resize events. These "
"overrides change the character grid, not the display width, and may alter "
"or crop the layout."
msgstr "加载后，占位提示会显示录制文件的原始行列数。留空可使用录制尺寸，并跟随录制中的尺寸变化。手动设置会改变字符网格，而非显示宽度，可能影响排版或裁切内容。"

#: src/edit.js:120
msgid "Playback"
msgstr "播放"

#: src/edit.js:121
msgid "Playback speed"
msgstr "播放速度"

#: src/edit.js:130
msgid "Player controls"
msgstr "播放控制栏"

#: src/edit.js:114
msgid "Player width"
msgstr "播放器宽度"

#: src/edit.js:124
msgid "Preload on published page"
msgstr "在发布后的页面预加载"

